	(text "DISPLAY subsystem  --  structure only (symbols with verified pin numbers land in Tasks 03/04)\n\n- Display-agnostic: the MCU renders to an external 'dumb' SPI panel over an FPC connector (J-DISP)\n- Curated driver family: ST7789 / ST7789V2 / ST7796\n- Reference panel: Waveshare 1.69in ST7789V2, 240x280 (EXTERNAL, consigned  --  not a placed panel on this board)\n- Touch: CST816 capacitive touch on I2C (INT / RST); touch is NOT accepted as approve/reject consent\n- Two layout variants share this one schematic: A = core-behind-display + FPC, B = core-with-display"
